  "assessment_and_plan": "Assessment: Upper respiratory infection, lymphadenopathy, and mild COVID-19 infection. Plan: Quarantine for 10 days, avoid household family members, and take off work if symptoms worsen. Continue Crestor 20 mg daily and monitor diet. Order another lipid panel in six months. No changes needed in coronary artery disease management. Stress test in six months for coronary artery bypass grafting."
