  "subjective": "CHIEF COMPLAINT: Reflux - Follow-up\nHISTORY OF PRESENT ILLNESS: Alexander, a 62-year-old male with a past medical history of reflux, reports that protonix has made a significant change in his life, making him comfortable and allowing him to eat whatever he wants without discomfort. He has been managing his diet by reducing caffeine and spicy foods and has switched to green tea. He reports that his job is going great and that his attitude has improved. He has a supportive family who check on him daily. He has no symptoms of chest pain, shortness of breath, belly pain, nausea, or vomiting.\nREVIEW OF SYSTEMS: No significant symptoms reported.",
